#: ../../source/docs/common-zubax-gnss-positioning-module-gps-compass-and-barometer.rst:5
#: 160ea5db597346b5a9f0e4547050c05f
msgid "Zubax GNSS Positioning Module — GPS, Compass and Barometer"
msgstr "Zubax GNSS 定位模块 — GPS、罗盘与气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zubax-gnss-positioning-module-gps-compass-and-barometer.rst:7
#: a71e645770ee4cc098ad6e90abb2c53a
msgid ""
"`Zubax GNSS 2 <https://zubax.com/products/gnss_2>`__ is a high-performance "
"positioning module for outdoor environments with doubly redundant `DroneCAN "
"<https://dronecan.org>`__ bus interface. It includes a state-of-the-art "
"GPS/GLONASS receiver, a high-precision barometer and a 3-axis compass."
msgstr ""
"`Zubax GNSS 2 <https://zubax.com/products/gnss_2>`__ 是一款面向户外环境的高性能定位模块，具备双冗余"
" `DroneCAN <https://dronecan.org>`__ 总线接口，集成了顶级 GPS/GLONASS 接收器、高精度气压计和三轴罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zubax-gnss-positioning-module-gps-compass-and-barometer.rst:15
#: f12c76cdb41d40ab80a13534375e48ff
msgid "Zubax GNSS 2: GPS, Compass and Barometer"
msgstr "Zubax GNSS 2：GPS、罗盘与气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zubax-gnss-positioning-module-gps-compass-and-barometer.rst:17
#: 748b517061af4fec96164d4651c06e1c
msgid ""
"The following parameter should be set on the autopilot (and then reboot the "
"autopilot):"
msgstr "应在飞控上设置以下参数（然后重启飞控）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-zubax-gnss-positioning-module-gps-compass-and-barometer.rst:19
#: 73c76cd5e9eb4da6b05d33f064a55417
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (to enable the 1st CAN port)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（启用第 1 路 CAN 接口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zubax-gnss-positioning-module-gps-compass-and-barometer.rst:20
#: cd36ac3d2f46477c93b01f22a90c1a58
msgid ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 9 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 9（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zubax-gnss-positioning-module-gps-compass-and-barometer.rst:22
#: 6275fc0edb6a46e48a807f756e38523e
msgid ""
"If the device does not work please follow the instructions on enabling the "
"CANBUS in the :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` page, followed by "
":ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` steps and then set the :ref:`GPS1_TYPE "
"<GPS1_TYPE>` or :ref:`GPS2_TYPE <GPS2_TYPE>` parameter to 9."
msgstr ""
"如果设备无法工作，请先按照 :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` 页面启用 CANBUS，再按照 "
":ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` 步骤操作，然后将 :ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` 或 "
":ref:`GPS2_TYPE <GPS2_TYPE>` 参数设置为 9。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zubax-gnss-positioning-module-gps-compass-and-barometer.rst:24
#: 8c16173017f4498eb053469692c48beb
msgid ""
"The `manufacturer's product page is here "
"<https://zubax.com/products/gnss_2>`__ for general information about the "
"device."
msgstr "设备的 `制造商产品页面在此 <https://zubax.com/products/gnss_2>`__，提供产品的一般信息。"
